version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-10-23
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22819727"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ahmadhuseynli/aermod-surrogate-research"
url: "https://ahmadhuseynli.github.io/aermod-surrogate-research/"
abstract: >-
  Final research closure for a generic AERMOD hourly dispersion surrogate.
  Early restricted-domain modelling improvements are retained alongside the
  later transfer, peak, applicability and product-feasibility failures.
  The October 2026 decision is practical no-go for the tested generic product
  formulation, not a proof against every possible atmospheric surrogate.
keywords:
  - AERMOD
  - atmospheric dispersion
  - air quality
  - surrogate modelling
  - machine learning
  - negative results
  - research closure
